#VideoOfTheWeek: Elga Coal Deposit — a Real Treasure of Yakutia!
⚡️ Located in the south of the Republic of Sakha (Yakutia), 300 km from the city of Neryungri;
🌎 One of the world's largest deposits of premium coking coal;
👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Reserves amount to 2.2 billion tons according to JORC standards;
⛏️ In 2024, production volume reached 28 million tons;
🏆 Thanks to the operation of the deposit, Yakutia entered the TOP-2 regions of Russia in terms of coal production volume!
🎥 Video: Elga
⚡️ Subscribe to the Ministry of Energy of Russia
